[ti:The Mill Wakes]
[ar:Nell Watson with Suno]
[al:Songs of the Living Mill]
[00:14.34]Before the road begins to shine
[00:16.84]Before the swallows leave the wire
[00:23.27]One green lamp in the control room
[00:39.68]Puts a heartbeat in the iron
[00:40.75]Alpha holds the summer
[00:41.36]Beta waits in gold
[00:43.00]Gamma, Delta, Epsilon
[00:45.68]Keep the harvest whole
[00:47.90]The augers take the first slow turn
[00:51.04]The roller beds grow warm
[00:53.06]Morning finds the skylights
[00:55.72]And the first load meets the floor
[00:57.76]Read the heat, read the pressure
[01:04.32]Hear the bearings answer back
[01:08.92]Every hand and every sensor
[01:11.80]Bring the living mill on track
[01:16.62]When the mill wakes, the whole line sings
[01:22.13]Grain leaves the silos, white flour flows
[01:26.86]Hands on the craft, eyes on the light
[01:30.20]We turn the field toward bread tonight
[01:32.54]When the mill wakes, we wake with it
[01:38.30]Every moving part finds the rhythm
[01:41.74]From first grain down to the last bag sealed
[01:46.58]We carry the promise of the field
[01:53.12]Four mills keep the rhythm
[01:55.20]Three sifters sweep and sway
[01:57.82]Three packer lines keep counting
[02:00.48]Every bag they fill and weigh
[02:03.63]Forklifts cross the marked lanes
[02:05.70]Bootsteps pass below
[02:07.60]Ten names fill the shift board
[02:10.50]And seventy-eight signals glow
[02:12.88]Read the trend, ask the question
[02:18.66]Let the quiet warning speak
[02:23.66]Skill is built from close attention
[02:26.84]Care is proven in each check
[02:31.78]When the mill wakes, the whole line sings
[02:36.82]Grain leaves the silos, white flour flows
[02:42.06]Hands on the craft, eyes on the light
[02:45.36]We turn the field toward bread tonight
[02:47.74]When the mill wakes, we wake with it
[02:53.58]Every moving part finds the rhythm
[02:56.96]From first grain down to the last bag sealed
[03:01.80]We carry the promise of the field
[03:08.46]One voice knows the long shift
[03:10.90]One can hold the wider view
[03:13.04]Bring the reason to the table
[03:15.80]Let the evidence come through
[03:18.16]Every worker gets a hearing
[03:20.88]Every mind can name its doubt
[03:23.30]The safest line is built together
[03:26.34]With the evidence laid out
[03:37.92]When the mill wakes, the whole line sings
[03:42.56]Grain leaves the silos, white flour flows
[03:47.44]Hands on the craft, eyes on the light
[03:51.02]We turn the field toward bread tonight
[03:53.42]When the mill wakes, we wake with it
[03:59.18]Every living voice finds the rhythm
[04:02.72]From first grain down to the last bag sealed
[04:07.62]We carry the promise of the field
[04:10.22]The first grain falls
[04:21.92]The daylight starts
[04:27.34]The mill wakes up
[04:29.16]And so do we
